{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Debug the verified boot chain",
  "hook": "How does verified boot chain trust from ROM to `vbmeta` to your system image?",
  "topic": "aosp/boot/avb-boot-chain",
  "tags": [
    "aosp",
    "avb",
    "boot"
  ],
  "level": "intermediate",
  "series": "aosp-boot-sequence",
  "series_index": 1,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "A modified image can fail before Android starts.",
      "narration": "Your rebuilt system image never reaches Android. Start with verified boot state when available; bootloader logs matter when the device cannot boot.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Read the boot state",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 12,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "inspect",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "sh",
          "text": "adb shell getprop \\\n  ro.boot.verifiedbootstate\nadb shell getprop \\\n  ro.boot.vbmeta.device_state",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 22,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 34,
          "at": 600,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        },
        {
          "id": "checks",
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Record locked versus unlocked",
            "An unlocked boot is not proof of trust"
          ],
          "x": 8,
          "y": 64,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 24,
          "color": "green",
          "at": 3400,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "vbmeta describes what must be verified; it is not the system image.",
      "narration": "On the build host, inspect vbmeta with avbtool. Follow chained partition descriptors too; system verification may be described in a different metadata image.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Inspect the metadata",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 12,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "inspect",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "sh",
          "text": "avbtool info_image \\\n  --image vbmeta.img\n# Inspect each referenced vbmeta\n# Hash / Hashtree / Chain descriptors",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 22,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 34,
          "at": 600,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        },
        {
          "id": "checks",
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Match the flashed build artifacts",
            "Descriptors identify verified partitions"
          ],
          "x": 8,
          "y": 64,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 24,
          "color": "green",
          "at": 3400,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "ROM trust and the bootloader's accepted AVB key anchor different steps.",
      "narration": "Device specific firmware verification reaches the bootloader. Its accepted AVB key authenticates vbmeta; signed descriptors bind images or delegate trust to another key.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Follow the trust",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 12,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "node0",
          "type": "box",
          "text": "ROM → verified bootloader",
          "x": 15,
          "y": 22,
          "w": 70,
          "h": 11,
          "color": "blue",
          "at": 600,
          "enter": "pop"
        },
        {
          "id": "node1",
          "type": "box",
          "text": "Accepted key → vbmeta → images",
          "x": 15,
          "y": 41,
          "w": 70,
          "h": 11,
          "color": "orange",
          "at": 1600,
          "enter": "pop"
        },
        {
          "id": "flow",
          "type": "arrow",
          "from": "node0",
          "to": "node1",
          "at": 2200,
          "enter": "draw"
        },
        {
          "id": "checks",
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Hashtrees support block verification",
            "Rollback indexes prevent old versions"
          ],
          "x": 8,
          "y": 64,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 24,
          "color": "green",
          "at": 3400,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Checking a signature is different from trusting its signer.",
      "narration": "A signature can be mathematically valid under an untrusted key. Verify against the expected key, and compare rollback metadata with device policy before debugging init.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Verify the right claim",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 12,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "inspect",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "sh",
          "text": "avbtool verify_image \\\n  --image vbmeta.img \\\n  --key expected.pem\n# Referenced images must be available",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 22,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 34,
          "at": 600,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        },
        {
          "id": "checks",
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Expected key is part of the check",
            "Device rollback state still matters"
          ],
          "x": 8,
          "y": 64,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 24,
          "color": "green",
          "at": 3400,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "takeaway": "Trace the trusted key and descriptors; a valid signature alone does not establish device trust.",
  "sources": [
    "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/avb/+/master/README.md"
  ]
}
